<x-screen-instructions title="How to use Subscription Plans">
    <p>Pricing tiers for whatever add-ons this club has flagged <strong>Subscribable</strong> (see Add-Ons) — what a member pays at check-in or from the Subscriptions list to buy monthly coverage for one.</p>
    <p>Plans are effective-dated: add a new plan with a future start date to schedule a price change rather than editing an existing one out from under historical records. Past purchases always keep the price they were actually charged.</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
